    "description": "Open one shared editable subscription form and wait for acknowledgement; opening does not save. Navigate to the requested ownership first. Reuse an active form. mode=widget imports the selected alert_widget native template; the current-page bell supplies live global filters. Open early with known independent operations. Blank missing titles and rule names receive editable native defaults; explicit input, template locks and existing values win. Retain the real source/template seed and reconcile its editable defaults with the user request. Use ordered components for content. Batch resolved query/output dependencies. presentation describes the actual step. finish=true validates the written revision and returns the manual preview/save handoff; structural readiness does not prove all user requirements were included.",
    "executor": "frontend",
